SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This license covers the code and data contained in this repository.

It does NOT cover the differentiable physics simulator or the base
evolutionary operators, which derive from ELDiR (Strgar, Matthews, Hummer &
Kriegman, Proceedings of Robotics: Science and Systems, 2024) and are not
redistributed here. Those files are obtained directly from
https://github.com/lstrgar/ELDiR and remain subject to whatever terms their
authors apply. See README.md and patches/README.md for how to reconstruct
them.
